WEBVTT

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:03.270
Hey...

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.810
Where am I?

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.240
You'll have to excuse us.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.750
We need to get back to take care of her.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.500
You gotta take care of yourself too.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.830
Don't worry about us.
You need to focus on Miss Ruri.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.630
You'll have full access
to our tracking status.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.630
We're grateful for your help.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:01.260
We'll be sure to get Naito
and bring Miss Ruri back.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:10.480
Wait, I'm coming with you.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.940
I know how you feel. But you can't.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.900
If anything should happen...

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.280
There would be no one there to stop you.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.250
What are you going to do, oni?

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.550
I'm gonna follow Kagami.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.970
That way I'll be sure to find out
Ruri's location, right?

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:42.680
I'd never thought
you'd be so desperate, oni.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.680
I get it, oni. Without Ruri around
you're just big trouble, oni.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:47.600
Shut up!

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.310
It's me.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.940
Beginning pursuit.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.610
Which direction is Naito's
tracking signal coming from?

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:59.240
Currently going over Mt. Oogusu,
heading toward Kamakura.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.900
The signal's been lost!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.660
What do you mean?
Coordinates?

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:06.660
<i>1 km north-north-east from your current location.</i>

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:12.170
<i>Mr. Kagami, I don't see any buildings that could be Naito's hideout in that area.</i>

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.170
There must to be something.
Take a closer look!

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.300
Wait a moment.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:20.920
There's an abandoned underground
army shelter nearby.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.470
The signal has been restored.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.890
It's moving further away!

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:28.930
Now what?

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.980
This might be his hideout.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.440
Come out, Tandoji!

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:39.690
You knew I was here?

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.360
It was pretty obvious
you were following me.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:44.780
Give me Oni-gawara.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:45.660
What?

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:49.660
We need the help.
He can come with me.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:54.420
The target once hid in these mountains,
but then moved on.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.040
But, there's a probability
that this is his hideout.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.630
You mean, Naito has gone elsewhere?

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:01.800
That's right.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.010
You stay and search the premises.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:07.680
If Naito isn't here, you don't have to worry
about turning into a Dark Stone.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.010
You're not saying that
just to get rid of me?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.310
I'm giving you this.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.310
If you find Miss Ruri, give it to her.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:16.350
This?

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:18.560
Don't lose it.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:22.490
It's so expensive, you could never
earn enough to reimburse her.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:27.780
<i>If you find anything, let me know immediately.</i>

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:28.740
Gotcha.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.040
Ruri...

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:42.670
You...

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.880
You're the one who escaped
from Kenmi's laboratory, aren't you?

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.900
Um, I need to use the restroom.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:05.490
Please.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.070
Just hold it.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:10.700
I can't.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.440
You tricked me.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:47.450
It was true I couldn't stand it,
being tied up on that thing.

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:54.080
You feel it?

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.620
You're the same as me.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.790
Where's Naito?

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:08.930
You didn't call for help,
so he's not here.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.050
Where's the exit?

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:11.640
It's no use.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.140
Only Naito can enter and leave here.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.810
Naito, he's holding you captive?

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.650
He saved me.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:22.480
What?

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:26.690
Because humans did horrible things to us.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.200
We just want to live in peace.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.910
But in a place like this?

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.490
I'm more scared of the outside world.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.620
There's people there.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.210
Why is that?

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:46.670
What humans did to my brother...

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:49.760
Kenmi...

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:52.130
...killed him.

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.050
Wait!

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:56.720
C'mon...

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.020
You're lying, aren't you?

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.480
I'd never lie.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.520
Me...

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:07.150
Naito...

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.150
We would never deceive anyone.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:13.700
If we did...

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.580
...we'd be just like the humans.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.080
<i>There's a message from the Aiba Foundation.</i>

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.710
Did they find Miss Ruri?

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.550
<i>It appears they may have found the hideout.</i>

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.880
Prepare the Cyclops.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.180
So, do you feel anything?

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:38.720
Nada, nothing so far, oni.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:41.600
He's moving along the freeway.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.690
He must have reverted back
and is moving by car.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:10.960
Contact Tandoji immediately!
The transmitter is a decoy!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:15.260
<i>We're unable to contact him.
He's outside the range of our signal!</i>

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:23.230
So you're Alma Tandoji.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:27.560
Naito Kijima...

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:32.070
I'll tell you everything.

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:34.280
This way.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.190
Ruri!

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:10.650
Alma!

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.190
How did you know I was here?

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.030
Fei!

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.360
It can't be.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:17.150
That's right, it was.

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:19.160
I told you to stay put.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.080
We have to take that child
to the hospital, immediately.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.200
It's no use.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.450
There's no hospital that can
take care of Fei properly.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:30.880
We're not supposed to exist
in human society.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:36.170
But you can't leave a child
alone in this condition.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.090
I'm OK.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.850
Don't worry about me.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.390
You don't look OK.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:47.180
You should worry about yourselves.
Not about others.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:48.810
What do you mean?

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:53.190
You don't understand what kind
of situation you're in, do you?

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:57.400
Kenmi has been deceiving you.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.070
That can't be.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.410
You need to be more suspicious of people.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:09.370
Not everything you see is the truth.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:14.040
Are you trying to say that Kenmi
is hiding something from us?

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.050
That's right.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:23.390
I was just told that the child's brother
was killed by Kenmi.

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.260
What?

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:26.560
Is that true?

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:28.230
Yes.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.900
What is going on in that laboratory?

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.150
Tell me.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:40.110
People like us, that hold
the power of the Sacred...

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:42.950
they're conducting
human experiments on us!

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:50.460
That is the truth.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.170
It can't be.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:58.170
We were held captive...

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.510
robbed of our freedom...

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.260
transformed into specimens...

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.510
cut into pieces and experimented upon.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:06.140
Kenmi, he...

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:10.180
He doesn't see us
Sacreds as humans.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:22.400
I took Fei with me
when I bolted out of that lab.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.620
If we let Kenmi live,
we're doomed to die.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.410
No, it's not just Kenmi.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.960
Any humans who realize how
to utilize our powers...

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.130
They all become our enemy!

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:43.300
How can that be?

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:46.930
That's the truth, accept it.

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.850
And never get in our way again.

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.020
Your way?

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:55.350
We can only become free
after I eliminate Kenmi!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.990
You're... telling us
to let you do that?

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.990
Alma Tandoji...

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:06.370
What are you fighting for?

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:14.460
I'm fighting to win back...

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.000
my freedom!

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:23.550
Fei!

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:36.270
What?

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:44.990
Fei! Are you OK?

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:48.280
Yes. Thank you, Ruri.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.620
You OK?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.080
Alma!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.630
This sensation.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.380
A Dark Stone!

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.020
That can't be.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:33.620
What?

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:39.380
Tandoji, Miss Ruri! Are you OK?

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:40.460
Where are you?

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.710
Mr. Kenmi.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:46.340
Oh no.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:13.780
Hung... You're still alive?

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.150
Kijima.

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.860
Kenmi, you bastard.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:58.870
Naito!

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:00.160
Fei!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:03.790
Naito!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:34.820
B...

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:36.910
Big brother...

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:45.880
Fei!

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.180
Alma!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.760
I'll unlock your powers.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.560
Kijima!

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:07.560
Running away?

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:16.870
Ruri.

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:21.700
Let's get outta here.

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.080
Right!

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:30.210
Your memories I take into me.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.590
My Soul...

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:36.890
I give to you.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:57.280
Tandoji.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.920
You saved me, Tandoji!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:11.960
A Dark Stone ends up like that
when their anger takes over.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:17.260
He escaped from our lab, and we've been
covertly trying to capture him.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:21.640
He must have smelled the
Dark Stone Kijima and come here.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:23.770
Really?

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:29.310
Tandoji, he's no longer human.

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:31.980
We can no longer just capture him.
We have to destroy him!

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:33.400
But...

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:42.830
We have to do it! Tandoji!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:45.580
I got it.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:48.540
Take this!

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:09.690
He got away.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:13.860
Mr. Kenmi.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.400
Are you OK?

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.860
No need to worry, Miss Ruri.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:21.370
I'm glad I made it in time
and that you're all right.

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:25.540
It was worth it coming here
even though I'm not fully healed.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:28.910
Mr. Kenmi?

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.750
Ah, don't worry.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:36.460
Tandoji, you were about
to say something back there.

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.630
Did something happen?

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:49.060
Hmm, so I was conducting human experiments
on those with the power of the Sacred Seven?

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.650
I see, so that's what you were told.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:57.570
Well it is true that we were trying
to unravel the power of the Sacred Seven.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:03.070
But, we would never do anything
that was inhumane.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:10.750
Kijima is a vicious criminal, having hurt
many people during his escape.

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:16.500
If you believe him,
you'll eventually follow his lead.

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:21.010
Still, everything is
all right now.

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:23.930
Thank you, Tandoji and Miss Ruri.

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:29.640
Rest assured.
I'll protect you with my life!

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.570
Who are you going to believe?

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:45.030
Mr. Kenmi? Naito?

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:48.620
I can't say for sure right now.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:52.960
I'm going to investigate this thoroughly
and get to the bottom of it.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.980
It was a risky gamble
to send out Number 0 for this.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:19.780
He can locate Fei, so I thought we could get
both Kijima and Fei at the same time.

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:23.740
But Kijima made contact
with Miss Ruri and Tandoji.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:27.030
So in order to keep
the two of them on our side.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:31.500
I had to put on an act
to avert their suspicion.

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:37.170
Though, Number 0 realizing
who Fei was...

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:39.880
...was unexpected.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:43.220
So suspicion toward us
has been averted?

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:47.760
I guess it's about time for us...

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:49.810
to pull something out of our sleeves.

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:54.180
Let's just wait and see
for the time being.

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:55.850
Understood.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:07.530
Naito...

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:10.240
So brother...

00:22:11.490 --> 00:22:15.660
So brother... didn't die after all?

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:18.790
<i>Kijima...</i>

00:22:19.790 --> 00:22:23.050
<i>You can't lay a hand on him, can you?</i>
